    "Runs entirely on-device via Apple MLX. Requires iOS 18+ and a physical device — no API key, no cloud, works offline. Tap a downloaded model to make it active.\n\nRule of thumb: smaller = faster but forgetful; bigger = better follow-ups and memory. SmolVLM2 is the best mix of vision + conversation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs entirely on-device via Apple MLX. Requires iOS 18+ and a physical device — no API key, no cloud, works offline. Tap a downloaded model to make it active.\n\nRule of thumb: smaller = faster but forgetful; bigger = better follow-ups and memory. SmolVLM2 is the best mix of vision + conversation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 Apple MLX 完全在设备上运行，需要 iOS 18 或更高版本及真机。无需 API 密钥或云端连接，可离线使用。轻点已下载的模型即可启用。\n\n通常，小模型速度更快，但对上下文的记忆较弱；大模型更擅长追问和记忆。SmolVLM2 兼顾视觉和对话能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
