    "Tap either language's button to start and stop recording. Set a limit from 30 to 300 seconds. At the limit, recording stops and waits for your tap to translate. Optionally end your own turn after a pause (default: 5 seconds); this also submits at the limit. Your partner always taps to finish. Changes are saved automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap either language's button to start and stop recording. Set a limit from 30 to 300 seconds. At the limit, recording stops and waits for your tap to translate. Optionally end your own turn after a pause (default: 5 seconds); this also submits at the limit. Your partner always taps to finish. Changes are saved automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击对应语言下方的按钮开始录音，再点一次结束。时长上限可设为 30～300 秒，到时停止收音，等你点击后翻译。可开启我方停顿后自动结束（默认停顿 5 秒），开启后到达上限也会自动提交。对方始终由你点击结束。设置自动保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the recording button again to finish.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
